; doorinspector.eval - the door inspector's Open on a leaf that cannot shut
; (code-review C356). Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 60, on its scratch
; world. The inspector edits the AUTHORED state (the record's open=), and the
; live leaf follows a change only when it can; it used to write the leaf's state
; straight through, so it could shut a wrecked door (which then would not open
; again) or close a door on a monster standing in it.
;
; Three wooden doors along a corridor, the party well clear of all of them.
; `editor inspector open on|off` is the Open checkbox, and prints the inspector's
; status after it, as the bare `editor inspector` does: the box (`open=`) beside
; the leaf as it stands (`live=`) and `broken=`. `doors` gives each door's state
; in play beside its authored one.
;
;   --- smashed ---  a door smashed down stands open. Open ticked, then
;                    unticked: the authored state goes shut, the leaf stays
;                    open and the log says why; saved, the record holds shut.
;   --- monster ---  a door opened with a skeleton standing in its doorway (the
;                    chooser lists both; `editor inspect ... door` picks the
;                    door's row). Ticked, then unticked: the close is REFUSED,
;                    the record's too - the box ticks itself again, the leaf
;                    stays open on the skeleton and the log says why. Esc's
;                    revert to the shut it was placed as is refused the same
;                    way, and the level saved holds open=1 beside the
;                    skeleton's record - saved with `savemap`, not the
;                    inspector's Save, which applies the ticked box once more
;                    on its way to the file and would mend a record the untick
;                    had left shut. A save writes the
;                    skeleton where it stands, so a record that took the close
;                    would shut the door on it at the next load.
;   --- empty ---    THE CONTROL: the same untick on an open door with nobody in
;                    its doorway shuts the leaf - so the two above were held
;                    open by the wreck and the skeleton, not by an inspector
;                    that moves no leaf at all.

logecho on
reset
timescale 0
lockstep on
freeze on
arena corridor 11
tp 10 12
face e
echo --- smashed ---
editor place doors wooden_door 12 12
smash 12 12 1000
doors
editor inspect 12 12
editor inspector
editor inspector open on
editor inspector open off
doors
messages 3
editor inspector save
echo --- monster ---
editor place doors wooden_door 15 12
opendoor 15 12
spawn skeleton 15 12 west 1 up
monsters
editor inspect 15 12 door
editor inspector
editor inspector open on
editor inspector open off
doors
messages 3
editor inspector esc
doors
savemap
echo --- empty ---
editor place doors wooden_door 18 12
opendoor 18 12
editor inspect 18 12
editor inspector
editor inspector open on
editor inspector open off
doors
editor inspector esc
echo --- end ---
